## 3. Configure NTFS Permissions

NTFS permissions were configured on `C:\Finance-Resources` to assign access to the `DomConsultancy-Finance` security group.

The Finance group was granted Read, write and execute permissions without Full Control.

### Permission Configuration

| Principal | Permission | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `DomConsultancy-Finance` | Read, write and execute | Allows authorised Finance group members to access and modify the resource |
| `Administrators` | Full control | Retains administrative management |
| `SYSTEM` | Full control | Retains operating system access |
| `CREATOR OWNER` | Full control for subfolders and files created by the owner | Preserves the existing creator-owner permission entry |

Full Control was deliberately withheld from the Finance group.

