## 6. Evaluate Sarah Williams's Effective Access

Sarah Williams is a member of `DomConsultancy-IT-Support`, not `DomConsultancy-Finance`.

The Effective Access feature was used to evaluate Sarah's permissions on the Finance folder without adding the Finance group to the calculation.

### Evaluated Permissions

The evaluation showed that the listed file and folder operations were denied, including:

- Traverse folder and execute file
- List folder contents and read data
- Read attributes and extended attributes
- Create files and write data
- Create folders and append data
- Delete subfolders and files

### Evidence 05 — Sarah Finance Access Denied

The screenshot shows Sarah Williams selected in Effective Access, with the listed permissions denied by the file permissions.

![Sarah Finance Access Denied](../screenshots/Evidence-05-Sarah-Finance-Access-Denied.png)

### Interpretation

Sarah has no effective access to the Finance resource under the evaluated permission configuration. This demonstrates the intended separation between Finance and IT Support access.

