## Result

A Finance test resource was created and protected using NTFS permissions assigned to `DomConsultancy-Finance`.

The Effective Access evaluations demonstrated:

- Alice's evaluated access when Finance group membership was included
- Sarah's lack of effective access to the Finance resource
- The absence of Full Control for the Finance group
- Separation between Finance and IT Support access

The lab now has a documented foundation for further access-control testing, including a real end-user access test from a separate Windows client and the later hybrid identity integration with Microsoft Entra ID.
